{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_title", "source_sha256": "a249b09f15daae215fc392fb7468053dcbd2a7eb6248f18f7d2bccdcd75dee46", "ja": "ミリシタ感謝祭　後説", "zh": "剧场时光感谢祭 闭幕广播", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0200c1837cb94e12a8ff150f32c6d61bdc770642cb66a7ba10f568fef2cdae19", "ja": "ミリシタ感謝祭、閉幕に際しての\n社長からの挨拶と、一本締めです。", "zh": "百万现场感谢祭闭幕之际，\n社长的致辞以及一次击掌礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1000_president", "source_sha256": "f71bb65043c00c06ab50340bf8364450ca6493d6f8847aa2f3c48868594ff3aa", "ja": "うおっほん！　我が765プロのプロデューサー諸君！\n『ミリシタ感謝祭』、楽しんでもらえたかな～？", "zh": "咳咳！我们765事务所的各位制作人！\n这次的“MILLISHITA感谢祭”，大家玩得还开心吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1001_president", "source_sha256": "8b8e876696dc9a881e25f8262bab9fc7f718c7192d52b6e2d0c1adefb01550e5", "ja": "うんうん、満足してくれたようで、私も満足だ！\nまさにWin-Winだね！　はっはっはっはっは！", "zh": "嗯嗯，看来你很满意，我也很满足！\n真可以说是双赢呢！哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1002_president", "source_sha256": "a4cdfa9df6ce834ae77be0e56865864ab51054c098773a809fcbf8b58b399165", "ja": "今日は感謝の気持ちと共に、諸君がプロデュースしてく\nれている数々のユニットの活動を振り返ったわけだが、", "zh": "今天，我怀着感谢之情，回顾了各位制作人负责制作的诸多组合的活动，不过，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1003_president", "source_sha256": "883e28db50934fdc07270b17e1e90dcca5716153ea86bf315ef4a749a4006cdc", "ja": "それぞれが持つ個性と、見事なまでのハーモニーと、\n楽曲が持つ魅力を、改めて感じてくれたことだろう！", "zh": "想必你也再次感受到了每个人各具特色的个性、无比美妙的和声，以及歌曲本身的魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1004_president", "source_sha256": "25f8ff0494c226383e53d6075fa919514f644e65e8d627284022cef843faf003", "ja": "中には、彼女たちの新たな可能性にピーンときた者も\nいるのではないかな？", "zh": "其中，想必也有人突然发现了她们新的可能性吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1005_president", "source_sha256": "fd5c2c37a5a7e66700b0dc587970964b7678579ddcbefde05f0a316c3e9d8e25", "ja": "諸君の胸に湧き上がった熱い思いと感動は、\n今後のプロデュース活動に存分に活かしてくれたまえ。", "zh": "诸位胸中涌起的热烈情感与感动，\n还请尽情运用到今后的制作活动中去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1006_president", "source_sha256": "cbf37daccb27de1e5ea58b6f4e9695baac15f1ab4d5873d5354adf32fea6c098", "ja": "そう！　我が765プロライブ劇場の未来は、\n紛れもなく、諸君の夢と情熱とともにある！", "zh": "没错！我们765Pro Live剧场的未来，毫无疑问，与各位的梦想和热情同在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1007_president", "source_sha256": "8d8b889aa6fabdb297fbe4167913873b849a7ee5e2892eced65c5282b3b483f7", "ja": "これからも、我が765プロのアイドル達を、\nよろしく頼むよー！", "zh": "今后也请多多关照我们765事务所的偶像们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1008_president", "source_sha256": "77264750e11150d9e18bb07125f0986b23600756bd8f6318d1b87e3b025f88af", "ja": "さて、ここで少しではあるが、我が765プロの\n今後の活動についての情報を伝えておこう。", "zh": "那么，在这里先告知一些关于我家765制作人今后活动的信息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1009_president", "source_sha256": "b5578728a47c0c4a20201af818c19cf4128c5487aeb2c3971d7035675657fa7f", "ja": "それでは……VTR、スタート！", "zh": "那么……录像，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1010_president", "source_sha256": "448544944394f11aece95e2c74442334e87583e12e1b801c2e759a29913ad2f5", "ja": "どうだったかね？　他にもいろいろな活動を\n予定しているのだが、それはおいおい伝えるとしよう。", "zh": "感觉如何？　其他还有各种活动安排，之后再慢慢告诉你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1011_president", "source_sha256": "8b19b96a8c36d5830ef4277434fd258fa50bcba8721283e3eaeacfc41bf9b95a", "ja": "さて、私も大変、名残惜しいが、そろそろ時間だ。\n最後は、恒例の一本締めで締めようではないか！", "zh": "那么，我也十分舍不得，但时间差不多了。\n最后，就按惯例用一次击掌来收尾吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1012_president", "source_sha256": "746d65c04fd14864d0b80e860fa6dcb02e88a85a3cd6afe232d2f733777b17b1", "ja": "いいかね？　私が、『よ～っ！』っと言ったら、\nパンっと1回、手を叩いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "听好了？等我说“预备～！”，\n就啪地拍1下手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1013_president", "source_sha256": "7c79f5068081f8035b32317f34cf1d20a25aaec03336de6a6fd4a6c1171ca8cb", "ja": "では、お手を拝借！　本感謝祭の成功を祝して、\nそしてアイドル達の、輝く未来に向かって！", "zh": "那么，请大家伸出手来！为本次感谢祭的成功，\n也为偶像们光辉的未来——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1014_president", "source_sha256": "01867248e2f30131d6ed83b05e2f1a4f84f0b37a65591d83d8da6a51d12eb8c1", "ja": "よ～～～！", "zh": "哟～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_02_1015_president", "source_sha256": "cf00535b4789c55b4cc1eba742279ba36595de3ede1214f2d0087ca16a90e3ce", "ja": "ありがとう～！\nそれでは、また会お～う！", "zh": "谢谢～！\n那么，下次再见～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
